      "QuantitativeHomeostasis is explicitly NEW exact post-step marginal plus empirical-frequency problem. It is not the old eventual-permanent event renamed. Positive IID epsilon strictly refutes that SAME original permanence event almost surely. epsilon<1 yields infinitely many actual returns; epsilon1 allows only degenerate maintenance rate0.",
      "Original P9 PreservesHomeostasis/recoveryScale consumes exact submitted/returned accepted pair, true protected-code alignment and projected SAME Organism history. No hpres, empirical maintenance certificate, reset, new action or resource port is input."
    ],
    "purpose": [
      "Original native Config pi=(time,actual causal memory,actual Organism) and advance/run are reused. Event list advance uses its literal encoded action, so arbitrary-p/q run projection is valid without pretending event-generation law equality; eventLaw/wordKernel/full word law equality THEN uses actual synthesize result.",
      "Exact full recordPathLaw and streamPayoff transport produce actualValue equality for submitted p/returned q and SAME projected parent/history. Meaningful value/order and all-causal comparison keep0<discount<1; total-integral transport at other discount values is not asserted as integrable optimization.",
      "Original actual record payoff integral equals original causal infiniteValue only with actual current-physical agreement and protected program=m.goal. actual_compiled_dominates_all_causal covers original fine physical/action-history causal competitors, not only quotient policies and not raw mode/label/journal oracles. price*writeCost<=1 remains explicit.",
      "Original P9 PurposeOrder is a declared birth-minus-priced-fee discount evaluation, but preservation and actual compared values are derived from event/record laws. Same physical parent path under all raw streams does NOT identify fees or purpose. Paid-target versus compiled actual values21/16 vs0 remain in SAME positive-price fixture."
    ],
    "god": [
      "Original GOD.lean BellmanGODCorrespondence is SET-valued optimal qValue equality; native greedyAction is only one witness. Active-row reward/physical source plus existing actual Bellman solution derive optimal-value and qValue projection; no desired factor/optimum field is installed.",
      "actual_god_action_iff preserves the entire same-action set. actual_god_selector_iff uses THISp/actualq and computed representative surjectivity in proofs; representatives are not executed resets. compiled_actual_p9_god actually invokes original P9 and same-q actual integral optimality.",
